    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out our new game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Use your balloon-gun to spawn and pop balloons wherever you want! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/ddd2e3eefaef2e83f03bb62605b86d96.poster.avif?t=1701692236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/ddd2e3eefaef2e83f03bb62605b86d96.webm?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/ddd2e3eefaef2e83f03bb62605b86d96.mp4?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Attach balloons to your glider and fly through the rings to gain more time but be careful - every ring is part of a challenging flying Island.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/81f8f2b3aeac4734715a447c93dd0a19.poster.avif?t=1701692236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/81f8f2b3aeac4734715a447c93dd0a19.webm?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/81f8f2b3aeac4734715a447c93dd0a19.mp4?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unlock new balloons and beat the highscore!",
    "about_the_game": "Use your balloon-gun to spawn and pop balloons wherever you want! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/ddd2e3eefaef2e83f03bb62605b86d96.poster.avif?t=1701692236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/ddd2e3eefaef2e83f03bb62605b86d96.webm?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/ddd2e3eefaef2e83f03bb62605b86d96.mp4?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Attach balloons to your glider and fly through the rings to gain more time but be careful - every ring is part of a challenging flying Island.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/81f8f2b3aeac4734715a447c93dd0a19.poster.avif?t=1701692236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/81f8f2b3aeac4734715a447c93dd0a19.webm?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612960/extras/81f8f2b3aeac4734715a447c93dd0a19.mp4?t=1701692236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unlock new balloons and beat the highscore!",
